        "collapsible_row_g8qHyR": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How it works",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<ol><li>Take a photo or video of your custom Durapole® in use.<br/></li><li>Complete the entry form below and choose how you'd like to submit your content:<br/><strong>Photos:</strong> Upload your photos directly through the form.<br/><strong>Videos:</strong> Upload your video to Google Drive and paste the shareable link into the video submission field, or choose the option to email your video separately.</li><li>Submit your entry!</li></ol><p>Once we've reviewed and approved your submission, we'll email your $20 discount code within <strong>5 working days</strong>.</p><p>Each eligible customer or business can submit one entry during the promotional period. You can include multiple photos and videos in one entry, but previously submitted content cannot be entered again.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_mEWF7H": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Photo & video tips",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<ul><li><strong>Portrait (vertical) orientation is preferred</strong>, especially for videos.<br/></li><li>Landscape photos and videos are welcome too!<br/></li><li>Shoot in good lighting so your flag and display are easy to see.<br/></li><li>Show the full pole, flag and mount where possible.<br/></li><li>Keep videos steady and capture your Durapole® from a few different angles.<br/></li><li>Videos around 10–20 seconds are ideal.<br/></li><li>Upload original photos and videos rather than screenshots or heavily compressed versions.</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_hhwkML": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Uploading videos",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>There are two ways to send us your video. Remember, you must complete the entry form first, regardless of which option you choose.</p><h3>Option 1: Share via Google Drive</h3><ol><li>Upload your video to Google Drive.</li><li>Right-click your video and select <strong>Share</strong>.</li><li>Under General access, change Restricted to <strong>Anyone with the link</strong>.</li><li>Set the permission to <strong>Viewer</strong>.</li><li>Select Copy link and paste the link into the video field on our entry form.</li></ol><p>Please check that your link allows anyone with the link to view your video before submitting your entry.</p><h3>Option 2: Email us your video</h3><p>If you prefer, you can email your video directly to <a href=\"mailto:designer@flagmakers.co.nz\"><strong>designer@flagmakers.co.nz</strong></a>.</p><ol><li>Complete your entry form.</li><li>Tick the box on the form to let us know you'll be emailing your video.</li><li>Submit your entry.</li><li>Attach your video to an email and send it to <a href=\"mailto:designer@flagmakers.co.nz\"><strong>designer@flagmakers.co.nz</strong></a>.</li><li>Include the <strong>name used on your entry form</strong> in your email so we can match your video to your submission.</li></ol>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_n3wcQY": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Photo & video credit",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>You can choose whether you'd like Flagmakers to credit you or your business if we feature your content in our marketing.</p><p>By entering, you give Flagmakers permission to use your submitted photos and videos in our marketing and promotional materials. You retain ownership of your content. Please make sure you have permission from anyone identifiable in your photos or videos before submitting them.</p><p>Read the full <a href=\"https://www.flagmakers.co.nz/pages/t-cs-show-us-your-durapole\">Terms & Conditions here</a>.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
